WEBVTT

00:00.582 --> 00:03.513
<i>[upbeat music]</i>
<i>[欢快的音乐]</i>

00:03.582 --> 00:10.306
<i>♪ ♪</i>
<i>♪♪</i>
<i>♪♪</i>
<i>♪♪</i>

00:10.375 --> 00:13.892
<i>- [sighs]
It's finally my lunchtime...</i>
<i>-[叹气]
终于到了我的午餐时间...</i>

00:13.961 --> 00:16.444
my only respite
from these cretins
我唯一的喘息机会
来自这些白痴

00:16.513 --> 00:19.030
and all the slop they call food.
还有所有他们称之为食物的泔水。

00:19.099 --> 00:21.203
[giggling]
[咯咯笑]

00:21.272 --> 00:23.030
[inhales]
[吸气]

00:23.099 --> 00:25.513
[chomping]
[咀嚼]

00:25.582 --> 00:26.858
[burps]
[dish shatters]
[打嗝]
[盘子碎了]

00:26.927 --> 00:29.237
[pleased hum]
Hello.
[高兴哼哼]
你好。

00:29.306 --> 00:31.134
Egh.
呃。

00:31.203 --> 00:34.341
Well, let's see what delectable
treats I packed myself today.
好啦，让我们看看有什么好吃的
今天我自己收拾了点心。

00:34.410 --> 00:36.134
Yoink!
You know the rules.
哟哟！
你知道规则。

00:36.203 --> 00:39.272
No outside food
in me restaurant.
没有外面的食物
在我的餐厅里。

00:39.341 --> 00:43.030
Oh, and Mr. Squidward,
I've got a hot date tonight,
哦，还有章鱼哥先生，
今晚我有一个热烈的约会

00:43.099 --> 00:45.444
so don't let no one bother me
for the next few hours.
所以不要让任何人打扰我
接下来的几个小时。

00:45.513 --> 00:47.548
I'm gonna be in the tanning bed,
我要躺在晒黑床上

00:47.617 --> 00:49.410
browning the leather...
使皮革变成褐色...

00:49.479 --> 00:51.479
[chuckles]
[笑声]

00:51.548 --> 00:53.030
Hello!
你好！

00:53.099 --> 00:54.582
[groans]
[呻吟]

00:54.651 --> 00:56.548
Here... let me see here.
这里……让我看看这里。

00:56.617 --> 00:59.341
Hmm, dried kelp strips?
嗯，干海带条？

00:59.410 --> 01:02.168
[groans]
Reduced fat sea water?
[呻吟]
海水减脂？

01:02.237 --> 01:03.961
[chuckles] That's weird.
[笑]这很奇怪。

01:04.030 --> 01:07.410
Jackpot!
Ice cream sandwich.
大奖！
冰淇淋三明治。

01:07.479 --> 01:09.617
[chomping]
[咀嚼]

01:09.686 --> 01:12.789
[giggling]
[咯咯笑]

01:25.513 --> 01:29.961
Ooh, nice and toasty in here.
哦，这里又漂亮又美味。

01:30.030 --> 01:32.858
I'll be back for you later.
我稍后会回来找你。

01:37.892 --> 01:41.099
♪ I got a krabby patty
for my favorite Pat ♪
♪ 我得到了蟹肉饼
为了我最喜欢的帕特♪

01:41.168 --> 01:43.823
♪ A patty pat for
my favorite Pat! ♪
♪ 一块肉饼拍拍
我最喜欢的帕特！ ♪

01:43.892 --> 01:46.134
Here you go, Patrick.
给你，帕特里克。

01:46.203 --> 01:48.720
- [gulping]
- Oh, mama, it's hot in here!
- [吞咽]
- 哦，妈妈，这里很热！

01:48.789 --> 01:50.237
What was that?
那是什么？

01:50.306 --> 01:53.927
Oh, Neptune, I'm melting!
哦，海王星，我融化了！

01:53.996 --> 01:56.479
Mr. Krabs' air conditioning
must be malfunctioning!
蟹老板的空调
一定是故障了！

01:56.548 --> 01:59.099
He could be mildly
uncomfortable!
他可以温和地
不舒服！

01:59.168 --> 02:01.617
[both grunting]
[两人都咕哝着]

02:01.686 --> 02:04.513
- - No, wait.
- Don't.
- - 不，等等。
- 不。

02:04.582 --> 02:06.789
[gasping]
Oh, Mr. Krabs!
[喘气]
哦，蟹老板！

02:06.858 --> 02:10.237
Are you okay?
Ah, speak to me!
你还好吗？
啊，跟我说话吧！

02:10.306 --> 02:13.168
[vocalizing]
[发声]

02:13.237 --> 02:15.548
- [sobbing]
- This doesn't look good.
- [抽泣]
- 这看起来不太好。

02:15.617 --> 02:18.306
He melted all over the floor.
他浑身都融化了。

02:18.375 --> 02:21.099
Mmm, strawberry.
嗯，草莓。

02:21.168 --> 02:23.203
Poor guy.
可怜的家伙。

02:23.272 --> 02:26.203
[sobbing]
Mr. Krabs... a tasty puddle...
[抽泣]
螃蟹先生...美味的水坑...

02:26.272 --> 02:29.030
He's... he's... he's dea...
他……他……他死了……

02:29.099 --> 02:32.099
[wailing]
[哀号]

02:32.168 --> 02:34.858
[laughs]
Oh, oh, look at that.
[笑]
哦，哦，看看那个。

02:34.927 --> 02:38.134
And right before
his big date tonight.
就在之前
今晚他的重要约会。

02:38.203 --> 02:39.755
What a shame.
真丢脸。

02:39.823 --> 02:43.306
A date?
Oh, must love die meltily
约会？
哦，爱必须融化地死去

02:43.375 --> 02:46.237
in my arms too?
[sobbing]
也在我怀里吗？
[抽泣]

02:46.306 --> 02:50.030
I guess he's just an empty
shell of the man he used to be.
我猜他只是一个空虚的人
他曾经的躯壳。

02:50.099 --> 02:51.892
[giggling]
[咯咯笑]

02:51.961 --> 02:53.961
Hey, Squidward, you're right!
嘿，章鱼哥，你说得对！

02:54.030 --> 02:56.099
Only Mr. Krabs' insides melted.
只有蟹老板的内心融化了。

02:56.168 --> 02:59.444
His shell is fine!
Maybe if we fill this back up
他的壳子还好啊！
也许如果我们填满这个备份

02:59.513 --> 03:01.789
with organs, he'll be okay!
有了器官，他就没事了！

03:01.858 --> 03:03.823
Say what now?
现在说什么？

03:05.858 --> 03:08.065
- Plankton!
- Ah, I didn't do it!
- 浮游生物！
- 啊，我没有这么做！

03:08.134 --> 03:10.513
We would like to purchase
one large drum of chum, please.
我们想购买
请给我一大桶密友。

03:10.582 --> 03:12.513
Extra organ-y.
额外的器官-y。

03:12.582 --> 03:15.341
Say what?
How do I know this isn't
说什么？
我怎么知道这不是

03:15.410 --> 03:18.823
a plot to steal
my secret chum formula?
偷窃的阴谋
我的密友配方？

03:19.996 --> 03:22.030
[both laughing]
[两人都笑了]

03:22.099 --> 03:24.686
Yoink!
哟哟！

03:24.755 --> 03:28.203
Enjoy your chum drum.
Yum, yum!
享受你的好友鼓吧。
嗯，嗯！

03:28.272 --> 03:31.306
Thanks, Plankton!
Love you.
谢谢，浮游生物！
爱你。

03:33.444 --> 03:36.375
Well all right, let's put some
kick back in this crab!
好吧，让我们放一些
踢回这只螃蟹！

03:36.444 --> 03:39.375
<i>[quirky music]</i>
<i>[古怪的音乐]</i>

03:39.444 --> 03:41.134
<i>♪ ♪</i>
<i>♪♪</i>
<i>♪♪</i>
<i>♪♪</i>

03:41.203 --> 03:44.030
[groaning]
[呻吟]

03:45.686 --> 03:48.755
[grunting]
[咕噜声]

03:53.030 --> 03:55.444
Hmm, we're still
missing something.
嗯，我们还在
缺少一些东西。

03:55.513 --> 03:57.755
Oh!
哦！

04:00.444 --> 04:02.272
A little zaparooni
ought to do it!
一点扎帕罗尼
应该这样做！

04:02.341 --> 04:04.306
The spark of life!
生命的火花！

04:04.375 --> 04:05.720
Doot!
杜特！

04:05.789 --> 04:08.686
<i>[dramatic music]</i>
<i>[戏剧音乐]</i>

04:08.755 --> 04:11.341
[groaning]
[呻吟]

04:11.410 --> 04:15.961
[garbling]
[乱码]

04:16.030 --> 04:18.548
He's alive!
He's alive!
他还活着！
他还活着！

04:18.617 --> 04:20.686
[laughs]
He's alive!
[笑]
他还活着！

04:20.755 --> 04:24.030
[garbling]
[乱码]

04:24.099 --> 04:26.755
Mr. Krabs seems
kind of dumb now.
蟹老板看来
现在有点傻了。

04:26.823 --> 04:28.548
Well, Patrick,
he has had a rough day.
好吧，帕特里克，
他度过了艰难的一天。

04:28.617 --> 04:30.144
We'll just have
to remind him of everything
我们只要
提醒他一切

04:30.168 --> 04:31.479
that makes him him again!
这让他再次成为他！

04:31.548 --> 04:32.892
Don't you worry, Mr. K.
别担心，K先生。

04:32.961 --> 04:34.558
We'll have you right
back up to speed before
我们会给你权利
恢复到之前的速度

04:34.582 --> 04:36.479
your big date tonight!
I promise!
今晚你的重要约会！
我保证！

04:36.548 --> 04:39.168
[garbling]
[乱码]

04:42.755 --> 04:45.755
Ooh, I'm done.
哦，我完成了。

04:45.823 --> 04:48.065
[grunting]
[咕噜声]

04:48.134 --> 04:51.203
Hey. Where'd me shell go?
嘿。我去哪儿了？

04:51.272 --> 04:53.651
I'm never that careless
with me carapace.
我从来没有那么粗心
和我一起甲壳。

04:53.720 --> 04:55.237
[watch beeps]
Oh, no!
[注意蜂鸣声]
哦，不！

04:55.306 --> 04:56.823
I'm running late.
我要迟到了。

04:56.892 --> 05:00.099
I'll just have to grab
me spare suit from home.
我只需要抓住
我从家里带了一套备用衣服。

05:00.168 --> 05:02.203
Okay, here. Ooh.
Uh-oh.
好的，在这里。哦。
呃哦。

05:02.272 --> 05:04.030
Let's see, if I time this right,
让我们看看，如果我时机合适的话

05:04.099 --> 05:06.444
no one will notice
me naked nethers.
没有人会注意到
我赤身裸体。

05:06.513 --> 05:09.306
[chomping]
[咀嚼]

05:09.375 --> 05:12.203
[baby crying]
[婴儿哭声]

05:14.927 --> 05:18.203
[grunting]
[咕噜声]

05:29.099 --> 05:32.479
Okay, Mr. Krabs,
this is your final test.
好的，蟹老板先生，
这是你的最后测试。

05:32.548 --> 05:33.755
What do you like more?
你更喜欢什么？

05:33.823 --> 05:36.479
Money or cookies?
钱还是饼干？

05:36.548 --> 05:38.548
[garbling]
[乱码]

05:38.617 --> 05:41.203
Don't say cookies.
Don't say cookies.
不要说饼干。
不要说饼干。

05:41.272 --> 05:43.823
Money.
钱。

05:43.892 --> 05:45.686
Right!
You're all ready for
正确的！
你已经准备好

05:45.755 --> 05:47.203
your date with Mrs. Puff!
你和泡芙夫人的约会！

05:47.272 --> 05:49.237
Hooray!
[all cheering]
万岁！
[大家欢呼]

05:49.306 --> 05:51.444
[grunts]
[咕哝]

05:55.961 --> 05:57.755
[laughs]
I made it!
[笑]
我做到了！

05:57.823 --> 05:59.479
Ew, Daddy!
呃，爸爸！

05:59.548 --> 06:03.444
You're naked and ruining
my cheerleader slumber party!
你赤身裸体，正在毁灭
我的啦啦队长睡衣派对！

06:03.513 --> 06:04.823
[gasps]
[喘气]

06:04.892 --> 06:06.720
all chanting:
Hey, hey, hey!
所有人都在喊口号：
嘿嘿嘿！

06:06.789 --> 06:08.479
Mr. K!
K先生！

06:08.548 --> 06:10.927
We don't wanna see
your booty today.
我们不想看到
你今天的战利品。

06:10.996 --> 06:12.720
[shrieks]
[尖叫声]

06:12.789 --> 06:14.823
[gasping]
[喘气]

06:14.892 --> 06:16.823
I know that spare
is in here somewhere.
我知道备用
就在这里的某个地方。

06:16.892 --> 06:18.548
Ah-ha!
啊哈！

06:18.617 --> 06:21.755
Ooh, haven't worn
this one in a while.
哦哦，没穿过
过一会儿就会有这个。

06:21.823 --> 06:23.823
Eh, well, it'll just have to do.
呃，好吧，只能这样了。

06:23.892 --> 06:25.868
I'm coming, me precious Puff!
- [cheerleaders scream]
我来了，我亲爱的泡芙！
- [啦啦队尖叫]

06:25.892 --> 06:27.237
<i>Daddy!</i>
<i>爸爸！</i>

06:27.306 --> 06:30.341
Okay, Mr. Krabs, here we are!
好的，蟹老板，我们到了！

06:30.410 --> 06:32.030
Just remember
everything we practiced
只要记住
我们练习的一切

06:32.099 --> 06:34.306
and your date will go just fine.
你的约会会很顺利。

06:34.375 --> 06:36.858
Good luck!
- Yeah, don't blow it.
祝你好运！
- 是啊，别吹了。

06:36.927 --> 06:39.168
[doorbell rings]
[门铃响]

06:39.237 --> 06:42.823
Oh, is that you, Eugene?
哦，是你吗，尤金？

06:42.892 --> 06:44.858
[groans]
[呻吟]

06:44.927 --> 06:46.513
Yes!
是的！

06:46.582 --> 06:48.099
Yes.
是的。

06:48.168 --> 06:50.961
Well, you're right on time,
嗯，你来得正是时候，

06:51.030 --> 06:53.375
for once.
What a treat.
一次。
真是一种享受。

06:53.444 --> 06:55.134
Yes.
是的。

06:55.203 --> 06:58.927
[laughing]
And so agreeable tonight.
[笑]
今晚真是太愉快了。

06:58.996 --> 07:00.582
Yes.
是的。

07:00.651 --> 07:02.927
Aww.
Oh, Patrick,
哇。
哦，帕特里克，

07:02.996 --> 07:05.203
Mr. Krabs may be the one
we brought back to life,
蟹老板可能就是那个人
我们复活了，

07:05.272 --> 07:08.099
but it's love we saved tonight.
但这是我们今晚拯救的爱。

07:10.030 --> 07:12.686
[groaning]
[呻吟]

07:12.755 --> 07:14.755
Puff!
噗！

07:14.823 --> 07:16.961
Puff!
You in there?
噗！
你在里面吗？

07:17.030 --> 07:20.548
I'm sorry I'm late for our date!
[grunts]
抱歉我约会迟到了！
[咕哝]

07:20.617 --> 07:22.479
[gasps]
Empty.
[喘气]
空。

07:22.548 --> 07:24.927
She must be waiting for me
at the restaurant.
她一定在等我
在餐厅。

07:24.996 --> 07:27.134
Oh, I hope she's waiting for me.
哦，我希望她在等我。

07:27.203 --> 07:29.617
[nervously gasps]
[紧张地喘气]

07:32.927 --> 07:35.444
[sighs]
You know,
[叹气]
你知道，

07:35.513 --> 07:39.272
there's something different
about you tonight, Eugene.
有一些不同的东西
今晚关于你，尤金。

07:39.341 --> 07:42.341
You've been
such a good listener.
你已经
这么好的倾听者。

07:42.410 --> 07:43.996
[grunts]
[咕哝]

07:44.065 --> 07:46.686
And that manly
new musk you're wearing...
还有那个男子气概
你戴的新麝香...

07:46.755 --> 07:48.686
[sniffs]
[嗅嗅]

07:48.755 --> 07:50.927
Oh, my.
哦，我的。

07:50.996 --> 07:52.996
[garbles]
[乱码]

07:53.065 --> 07:55.341
Chum.
密友。

07:55.410 --> 08:00.479
Oh, I think we're way
past being chums, Eugene!
哦，我想我们已经这样了
过去是朋友了，尤金！

08:00.548 --> 08:02.651
[moaning]
[呻吟]

08:02.720 --> 08:05.168
Ooh, Patrick,
their date is going great.
哦，帕特里克，
他们的约会进行得很顺利。

08:05.237 --> 08:08.030
I say, do you mind?
我说，你介意吗？

08:08.099 --> 08:10.168
[gasping]
[喘气]

08:10.237 --> 08:13.617
Don't worry,
I'm here, me puffy princess!
别担心，
我来了，我的小公主！

08:13.686 --> 08:16.134
- [giggles]
- What?
- [咯咯笑]
- 什么？

08:16.203 --> 08:19.686
Who is that clown
clawing at me woman?
那个小丑是谁
女人抓我？

08:19.755 --> 08:23.203
[growling]
[咆哮]

08:23.272 --> 08:26.203
What in Davy Jones'
戴维·琼斯的里面有什么

08:26.272 --> 08:28.410
Gym Locker is going on here?
健身房储物柜在这里发生？

08:28.479 --> 08:30.617
- Who is that?
- I don't know,
- 那是谁？
- 我不知道，

08:30.686 --> 08:33.892
but we better stop him
before he ruins everything!
但我们最好阻止他
在他毁掉一切之前！

08:33.961 --> 08:36.099
[both grunting]
[两人都咕哝着]

08:36.168 --> 08:37.961
Sorry, Mr. Krabs.
Sorry Mrs. Puff.
对不起，蟹老板。
对不起，泡芙女士。

08:38.030 --> 08:39.755
Enjoy the rest of your date!
享受剩下的约会吧！

08:39.823 --> 08:42.030
[grunts]
[咕哝]

08:42.099 --> 08:45.548
What are you doing, boy-o?
It's me, Mr. Krabs,
你在做什么，小伙子？
是我，蟹老板，

08:45.617 --> 08:48.168
your lovesick employerer!
你的相思病雇主！

08:48.237 --> 08:51.755
Lovesick employer?
Clever imposter, you mean!
患相思病的雇主？
你是说，聪明的冒名顶替者！

08:51.823 --> 08:53.996
Hmm.
唔。

08:54.065 --> 08:56.444
[laughing]
[笑]

08:56.513 --> 09:00.134
That's the real Mr. Krabs,
you idiots!
这才是真正的蟹老板
你们这些白痴！

09:00.203 --> 09:01.892
Oh, and Eugene...
哦，还有尤金……

09:01.961 --> 09:03.823
your teenage self called.
你十几岁的自己这样称呼。

09:03.892 --> 09:05.823
He wants his prom tux back!
他想要回他的舞会礼服！

09:05.892 --> 09:09.272
[laughing]
- [grunts]
[笑]
- [咕哝]

09:09.341 --> 09:11.410
Sorry, sir.
We thought you had melted,
对不起，先生。
我们以为你已经融化了

09:11.479 --> 09:13.789
and so we brought you
back to life with chum!
所以我们给你带来了
和密友一起复活！

09:13.858 --> 09:15.444
Anybody would've
done the same thing.
任何人都会
做了同样的事情。

09:15.513 --> 09:17.582
[stammering]
[结巴]

09:17.651 --> 09:19.237
Melted? Chum?
融化了？密友？

09:19.306 --> 09:21.237
What're you
goin' on about, boy-o?
你是什么
继续说下去吗，男孩？

09:21.306 --> 09:23.410
- [giggling]
- [garbling]
- [咯咯笑]
- [乱码]

09:23.479 --> 09:25.479
[both grunt]
[两人咕哝]

09:25.548 --> 09:29.065
Get your mitts
off me gal, bucko!
戴上你的手套
放开我吧，姑娘，布科！

09:29.134 --> 09:31.651
Oh!
哦！

09:31.720 --> 09:33.720
You're not going to take that
from a stranger,
你不会接受的
来自一个陌生人，

09:33.789 --> 09:34.996
are you, Eugene?
是你吗，尤金？

09:35.065 --> 09:37.099
Fight for my love!
为我的爱而战！

09:37.168 --> 09:39.134
[both grunting]
[两人都咕哝着]

09:39.203 --> 09:40.823
Ah!
This is all
啊!
这就是全部

09:40.892 --> 09:42.651
a big misunderstanding.
一个天大的误会。

09:45.203 --> 09:48.134
[garbling]
[乱码]

09:50.479 --> 09:52.479
Hey!
嘿！

09:52.548 --> 09:54.065
Ow!
噢！

09:54.134 --> 09:55.858
[growling]
[咆哮]

09:55.927 --> 09:59.720
[grunting]
[咕噜声]

10:01.927 --> 10:04.617
[both groan]
[两人都呻吟]

10:04.686 --> 10:06.686
[garbling]
[乱码]

10:06.755 --> 10:07.789
Oh...
哦...

10:07.858 --> 10:10.617
I lost the fight and me Puff.
我输掉了这场战斗，也输掉了我的泡芙。

10:10.686 --> 10:12.548
[groaning]
[呻吟]

10:12.617 --> 10:14.582
Uh-oh...
呃-哦...

10:14.651 --> 10:17.099
[chuckles]
I win!
[笑声]
我赢了！

10:17.168 --> 10:19.030
Well, kind of.
嗯，有点。

10:19.099 --> 10:21.099
Sorry, Eugene.
对不起，尤金。

10:21.168 --> 10:24.789
I guess I couldn't see past
your handsome exterior...
我想我看不到过去
你帅气的外表...

10:24.858 --> 10:27.858
Oh, baby, it's okay.
哦，宝贝，没关系。

10:27.927 --> 10:30.134
[groans]
Ew.
[呻吟]
呃。

10:30.203 --> 10:32.720
Sure hope I can get
this stink out of me shell.
当然希望我能得到
我的壳里散发出这种臭味。

10:32.789 --> 10:34.651
I like it.
我喜欢它。

10:40.306 --> 10:41.961
Sorry about the mix-up, chummy.
抱歉搞混了，伙计。

10:42.030 --> 10:45.168
You may not be Mr. Krabs,
but you can still be our friend!
你可能不是蟹老板，
但你仍然可以成为我们的朋友！

10:45.237 --> 10:47.617
[garbling]
Friends.
[乱码]
朋友们。

10:47.686 --> 10:50.548
[laughter]
[笑声]

[笑声]